8. COMPLETE SIX-GARAGE BOOKING SYSTEM

THIS IS THE MOST IMPORTANT MODULE.

Build a fully functional online booking system for all six garages.

The customer booking process must follow this exact sequence:

STEP 1: Customer logs in.

STEP 2: Customer selects a registered vehicle.

STEP 3: Customer selects one of the six active garages.

STEP 4: Customer views services available at that garage.

STEP 5: Customer selects service category.

STEP 6: Customer selects service package.

STEP 7: Customer selects appointment date.

STEP 8: Customer selects an available time slot.

STEP 9: Customer describes the vehicle problem.

STEP 10: Customer uploads optional vehicle photographs.

STEP 11: Customer reviews the booking details.

STEP 12: Customer clicks Submit Booking.

STEP 13: Generate a unique booking ID.

STEP 14: Save the booking in Firestore with the correct garageId and customerId.

STEP 15: Initial status must be PENDING.

STEP 16: Notify only the selected garage manager.

STEP 17: Display the booking in the customer's My Bookings page.

